216	    // enchantment - 20 loyalty + 10 first insurance - 15 follow-up = 155 + 5
217	    // = 160". Loyalty there is 20 (20% of the unmodified 100), not 20% of the
218	    // modifier-inflated 180. If policy-wide modifiers applied to a base that
